# SSAO deinterleave (reports/engine/2026-11-08-ssao-deinterleave): the same clips before and after, judged side by
# side as clips. Places where AO shows: eaves, corners and people in the market, a slow camera turn by the roofs
# (does the 2x2 pattern swim), the forest road, the candle-lit harbour house.
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/ssao-clips.bench
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
# 1. The market at noon: the hero walks, the camera follows
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 120
cam follow 380 170 160
wait 10000
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
rec ssao-market
wait 7000
stop
# 2. A slow turn of the camera by the market roofs: it stands, the hero walks off and it turns after him
cam cut
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
walkmode walk
cam look 350
cam world 700 280 270
wait 10000
cam fixed
walkto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_SHOP01_FRONT_03
wait 500
rec ssao-roofs-turn
wait 7000
stop
# 3. The forest road: leaves in the wind, the camera holds still
cam cut
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_16
watch player
cam look 150
cam world 500 230 0
wait 10000
cam hold
rec ssao-forest
wait 7000
stop
# 4. The candle-lit harbour house at night (perf-interior.bench, view 2: the hearth), then the camera turns to view 3
cam cut
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 90
wait 10000
cam hold
rec ssao-interior
wait 3500
cam world 160 170 180
wait 3500
stop
